hadiths[29]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2094","[AI-translation] ´Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` aik din Jibrail alaihissalam Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas baithay hue thay ke darwaza khulnay ki aik baray zor ki aawaz suni to apna sar uthaya aur Jibrail alaihissalam ne kaha ke ye aasmaan ka aik darwaza hai jo aaj khula hai aaj se pehle aur kabhi nahi khula tha pas us se aik farishta utra aur Jibrail alaihissalam ne kaha ke ye farishta jo zameen par utra hai aaj ke din ke ilawa kabhi nahi utra aur us ne salam kiya aur kaha ke Aap ko do nooron ki khushkhabri ho jo ke Aap ko inayat hue hain wo Aap ke siwa kisi Nabi ko nahi milay aik Surah Fatiha hai aur doosray Surah Baqarah ki aayaat tum us mein se koi harf na padho ge ke us ki maangi hui cheez tumhein na milay "
"2095","[AI-translation] ´Abu Umama Baahili raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` mein ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke Quran padho us liye ke wo qayamat ke din apne padhnay walon ka sifarishi ho kar aaye ga aur chamakti hui do surtein padho jo ke Surah Baqarah aur Surah aal Imran hain us liye ke wo qayamat ke din aayein gi goya ke do baadal hain ya do saaybaan ya do toliyaan hain parindon ki aur apne logon ki taraf se hujjat karti hui aayein gi aur Surah Baqarah padhnay ka lena barkat hai aur us ka chhorna hasrat hai aur jadugar log us ka muqabla nahi kar saktay Muawiya ne kaha ke hadees mein jo batala ka lafz hai us ka maani jadugar hai "
"2096","[AI-translation] ´Abu bin Ka'b raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Ae Abu Munzir ! Allah ki kitab mein tumharay paas kaun si aayat sab se bari hai mein ne arz kiya ke Allah aur us ka Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam khoob jantay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae Abu Munzir ! kaun si aayat Allah ki kitab mein tumharay paas sab se bari hai mein ne arz kiya ke ((Allah la ilaah illa huw al-Hayy al-Qayyoom)) (yani aayat al-Kursi) to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mere seena par (khush ho kar) haath maara aur farmaya ke Ae Abu Munzir ! tujhe ilm mubarak ho "
"2097","[AI-translation] ´Abu Mas'ud raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jo Surah Baqarah ki aakhir ki do aayaat padhay us ko raat bhar kifayat karein gi "
"2098","[AI-translation] ´Abu Darda raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke` Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : jo shakhs Surah Kahf ki ibtidaayi das aayaat yaad karay wo Dajjal ke fitna se bachay ga aik riwayat mein hai ke Surah Kahf ki aakhri aayaat (yaad karnay se Dajjal se panah milay gi) "
"2099","[AI-translation] ´Abu Darda raziyallahu anhu Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kartay hain ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : kiya tum mein se koi us baat se aajiz hai ke har raat aik tihayi Quran padh le sahaba ne arz kiya ke koi tihayi Quran kaisay padh sakta hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ((Qul Huwallahu Ahad)) tihayi Quran ke barabar hai "
"2100","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik shakhs ko aik fauj par sardar kar ke bheja aur wo apni fauj ki namaz mein Quran padhtay aur qiraat ko hamesha ((Qul Huwallahu Ahad)) par khatm kartay phir jab fauj laut kar aayi to logon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se us baat ka zikr kiya to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke un se poocho ke wo kyun aisa kartay thay pas sahaba kiraam ne un se poocha to unhon ne kaha ke ye Rahman ki sifat hai aur mein baat pasand karta hun ke us ko padha karun Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke un se keh do ke Allah Taala tum se mohabbat rakhta hai "
"2101","[AI-translation] ´Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : tum nahi dekhtay ke aaj ki raat aisi aayaat utarein hain ke un jaisi (surtein) kabhi nahi dekhi gayein aur wo ((Qul a'uzu bi rabb al-falaq)) aur ((Qul a'uzu bi rabb an-naas)) hain "
"2102","[AI-translation] ´Amir bin Wasila se riwayat hai ke` Nafi bin Abdul Haaris ne Umar raziyallahu anhu se (muqaam) Usfan mein mulaqat ki aur Umar raziyallahu anhu ne un ko Makka par aamil / tehseeldaar banaya hua tha Umar raziyallahu anhu ne poocha ke tum ne jungle walon par kis ko aamil banaya unhon ne kaha ke bin Abza ko Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke bin Abza kaun hai unhon ne kaha ke hamaray azaad kardah ghulamon mein se aik ghulam hai Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke tum ne ghulam ko un par aamil kar diya unhon ne kaha ke wo kitab Allah ke qaari hain aur ilm al-faraaiz (yani qawaaneen wiraasat jisay Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne nisf al-ilm qarar diya hai) khoob jantay hain Umar raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke suno tumharay Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya hai ke Allah Taala us kitab ke sabab se kuch logon ko buland karay ga aur kuch logon ko gira de ga "
"2103","[AI-translation] ´Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam niklay aur ham log Suffa mein thay pas Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum mein se kaun chahta hai ke roz subah ko Buthaan ya Aqeeq ko jaye (ye donon Madina ke bazaar thay) aur wahan se baray baray kohaan ki do oontniyan baghair kisi gunah ki aur baghair us ke ke kisi rishta daar ki haq talfi karay laaye to ham ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! ham sab us ko chahtay hain Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke phir tum mein se har aik masjid ko kyun nahi jata aur kyun nahi seekhta ya padhta Allah ki kitab ki do aayaat jo us ke liye do oontnion se behtar hain aur teen behtar hain teen oontnion se aur chaar behtar hain chaar oontnion se aur usi tarah jitni aayaat hun itni oontnion se behtar hain "
"2104","[AI-translation] ´Abu Musa Ashari (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Quran padhnay walay momin ki misaal turanj ki si hai ke us ki khushbu bhi umda hai aur us ka maza bhi acha hai aur Quran na padhnay walay momin ki misaal khajoor ki si hai ke us mein boo nahi magar maza meetha hai aur Quran padhnay walay munafiq ki misaal phool ke manind hai ke us ki boo achi hai lekin us ka maza karwa hai aur Quran na padhnay walay munafiq ki misaal indaraain (koor tanbah) ki si hai ke us mein khushbu bhi nahi aur maza bhi karwa hai "
"2105","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Quran ka mashshaaq (us se haafiz muraad ho sakta hai jo ke aamil ho) un buzurg farishton ke saath hai jo lauh mehfooz ke paas likhtay rehtay hain aur jo Quran padhta hai aur us mein atakta hai aur wo us ke liye mashaqqat ka baa'is hai to us ke liye do guna sawab hai "
"2106","[AI-translation] ´Bara (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` aik shakhs Surah Kahf padh raha tha aur us ke pas do lambi rassion mein aik ghora bandha hua tha pas us par aik badali chha gayi jo ghoomnay aur qareeb aanay lagi aur usay dekh kar us ka ghora bidaknay laga phir jab subah hui to wo shakhs Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur (raat ke waqia) ka zikr kiya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ye to sakeenat (taskeen) thi jo Quran ki barkat se naazil hui thi "
"2107","[AI-translation] ´Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` Usaid bin Huzair raziyallahu anhu apni khajoorein khushk karnay ki jagah mein aik raat Quran padh rahay thay ke un ka ghora koodnay laga aur wo padhtay thay to ghora koodta tha phir wo padhnay lagay phir wo koodnay laga unhon ne kaha ke mein dara ke kahein (mere betay) Yahya ko kuchal na daalay pas mein us ke paas ja khara hua aur kiya dekhta hun ke aik saaybaan sa mere sar par hai ke us mein chiraagh se roshan hain aur wo upar ko charh gaya yahan tak ke had nazar se door chala gaya phir na dekha phir mein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki khidmat mein subah ko haazir hua aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! raat ko mein apne khariyaan mein Quran padhta tha ke achanak mera ghora koodnay laga Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke padhay ja Ae bin Huzair ! unhon ne kaha ke mein padhay gaya ghora phir koodnay laga phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke Ae bin Huzair padhay ja unhon ne kaha ke mein padhta gaya to ghora waisay hi koodnay laga phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke padhay ja Ae bin Huzair ! unhon ne kaha ke jab mein farigh hua aur Yahya ghoray ke paas tha to mujhe khauf hua ke kahein Yahya ko na kuchal daalay to mein ne aik saaybaan sa dekha ke us mein chiraagh se roshan thay aur wo upar ko charh gaya yahan tak ke had nazar se upar ho gaya tab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ye farishtay thay jo tumhari qiraat sun rahay thay aur agar tum padhtay rehtay to usi tarah subah hoti ke log un (farishton) ko dekhtay aur wo un ki nazar se posheeda na rehtay "
"2108","[AI-translation] ´Salim apne walid Abdullah raziyallahu anhu se riwayat kartay hain aur wo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se ke` Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : do mardon ke siwa aur kisi par rashk jaaiz nahi hai aik to wo jis ko Allah Taala ne Quran inayat kiya ho aur wo us din raat padhta ho (aur us par amal karta ho) doosray wo jisay Allah Taala ne maal diya ho aur wo din raat usay (Allah ki raah mein) kharch karta ho "
"2109","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne irshaad farmaya ke Quran yaad karnay walay ki misaal aisi hai jaisay aik peer bandhe hue oont ki ke agar us ke Maalik ne us ka khayal rakha to (oont maujood) raha aur agar chhor diya to (oont bhi kahein) chal diya "
"2110","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : tum mein se bohat bura hai wo shakhs jo ye kahay ke mein falan falan aayat bhool gaya hun balke yun kehna chahiye ke bhala diya gaya hun aur Quran ka khayal aur yaad daasht rakho ke wo logon ke seenon se un janwaron se zyada bhaagnay wala hai jin ki aik taang bandhi ho "
"2111","[AI-translation] ´Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke` unhon ne Nabi usay suna Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmatay thay ke Allah Taala us tarah kisi cheez ko nahi sunta jis tarah khush aawaz Nabi ki aawaz sunta hai jo buland tarannum se Quran padhta ho "
"2112","[AI-translation] ´Burda Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kartay hain unhon ne kaha ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : agar tum mujhe dekhtay jab mein kal raat tumhari qiraat sun raha tha (to bohat khush hotay) beshak tumhein aal Dawood ki aawazon mein se aik aawaz di gayi hai "
"2113","[AI-translation] ´Muawiya bin Qurra kehtay hain ke` mein ne Abdullah bin Mughaffal raziyallahu anhu se suna wo kehtay thay ke jis saal Makka fatah hua us saal Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne rastay mein Surah al-Fath apni sawaari par padhi aur apni qiraat mein aawaz mein sar lagatay thay Muawiya raziyallahu anhu ne kaha ke agar mujhe us baat ka khauf na hota ke log mujhe ghair lein ge to mein tumhein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki qiraat sunata "
"2114","[AI-translation] ´Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke` Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aik shakhs ko raat ko Quran padhtay hue suna to farmaya ke Allah Taala us par rehmat karay us ne mujhe falan aayat yaad dila di jis ko mein falan Surah se chhor deta tha "
"2115","[AI-translation] ´Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` mein ne Hisham bin Hakeem bin Hizam raziyallahu anhu se suna ke wo Surah Furqan us tareeqa ke ilawa padh rahay thay jis tareeqa par mujhe Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne padhayi pas mein qareeb tha ke un ko jald pakar lun magar mein ne unhein mohlat di yahan tak ke wo padh chukay phir mein un ki chaadar un ke galay mein daal kar kheenchtay hue aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tak laya aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! mein ne unhein Surah Furqan suni us tareeqay ke khilaf jaisay ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujhe padhayi hai Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke acha un ko chhor do aur un se kaha ke padho unhon ne waisa hi padha jaisa mein ne un se pehle suna tha aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ye Surah aisay hi naazil hai phir mujh se kaha ke padho mein ne bhi padhi (yani jaisay Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujhe padhayi thi) tab bhi Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke ye aisay hi naazil hai aur farmaya ke Quran saat harfon par utra hai us mein se jo tumhein aasaan ho us tarah padho "
"2116","[AI-translation] ´Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Abu bin Ka'b raziyallahu anhu se farmaya ke (aur ye sab qaariyon ke sardar hain) Allah izzat walay aur buzrugi walay ne mujhe hukm kiya ke mein tumharay aagay Surah ((lam yakun allazina kafaru ....)) padhun unhon ne arz kiya ke kiya Allah Jal Jalaluhu ne mera naam liya hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke haan (Allah Taala ne mere aagay tumhara naam liya hai) to Abu bin Ka'b raziyallahu anhu (khushi se) ronay lagay "
"2117","[AI-translation] ´Amir ash-Sha'bi kehtay hain ke mein ne Alqama se poocha ke` kiya Lailat-ul-Jinn mein Ibn Masud (raziyallahu anhuma) Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath thay unhon ne kaha ke mein ne Ibn Masud (raziyallahu anhuma) se poocha tha kiya Lailat-ul-Jinn mein tum mein se koi Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath tha (yani jis raat Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne jinon se mulaqat farmayi) unhon ne kaha ke nahi lekin aik roz ham Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath thay ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ghum paya pas ham ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko pahar ki waadion aur ghaation mein talaash kiya lekin Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam na milay ham samjhay ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko jin ura le gaye ya kisi ne chupkay se maar daalnay aur raat ham ne nihayat buray taur se Busr ki jab subah hui to dekha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Hira (Jabal noor pahar hai jo Makka aur Mina ke darmiyan mein hai) ki taraf se aa rahay hain ham ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool ! raat ko ham ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko ghum paya aur jab talaash ke bawajood bhi Aap na milay to aakhir ham ne (Aap ke baghair) bohat buray taur se raat guzaari Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mujhe jinon ki taraf se aik bulanay wala aaya to mein us ke saath chala gaya aur jinon ko Quran sunaya phir Aap hamein apne saath le gaye aur un ke nishan aur un ke angaaron ke nishan batlaye jinon ne Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se zaad-e-raah chaha to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke us janwar ki har haddi jo Allah ke naam par kaata jaye wo tumhari khuraak hai tumharay haath mein partay hi wo gosht se par ho jaye gi aur har aik oont ki maingni tumharay janwaron ki khuraak hai Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke haddi aur maingni se istinja mat karo kyunke wo tumharay bhai jinon (aur un ke janwaron) ki khuraak hai "
"2118","[AI-translation] ´Ma'n kehtay hain ke mein ne apne walid se suna unhon ne kaha ke` mein ne Masrooq se poocha ke jis raat jinon ne aa kar Quran suna to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko us baat ki khabar kis ne di unhon ne kaha ke mujh se tumharay baap (yani Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma)) ne bayan kiya ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko jinon ke aanay ki khabar darakht ne di thi "
"2119","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujh se farmaya ke tum mere saamnay Quran padho mein ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ! mein Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke aagay Quran padhun halanke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hi par to utra hai Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke mera ji chahta hai ke mein aur se sunon phir mein ne Surah Nisa padhi yahan tak ke jab mein us aayat par pahuncha ((fakaif iza ji'na)) (Nisa : 41) to mein ne sar uthaya ya mujhe kisi ne chutki li to mein ne sar uthaya aur dekha ke Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke aansu beh rahay thay "
"2120","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` mein Hims mein tha ke logon ne mujh se Quran sunanay ko kaha mein ne Surah Yusuf padhi aik shakhs ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ! aisa nahi utra mein ne kaha ke teri kharaabi ho Allah ki qasam ! mein ne to ye surat Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke aagay padhi thi to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum ne khoob padha gharz mein us se baat kar hi raha tha ke mein ne us se sharaab ki boo paayi mein ne kaha ke to sharaab peeta hai aur Allah ki kitab ko jhutlaata hai to janay na paye ga jab tak mein tujhe had na maar lun ga phir mein ne usay (sharaab ki had ke) koray maaray "
"2121","[AI-translation] ´Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) kehtay hain ke` aik din mein subah sauiray Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas gaya Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne do aadmiyon ki aawaz suni jo aik aayat ke baaray mein jhagar rahay thay to Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam bahar niklay aur Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke chehray par ghussa maloom hota tha Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya ke tum se pehle log Allah Taala ki kitab mein jhagra karnay ki wajah se tabah hue (jo nafssaniyat aur fasaad ki niyyat se ho ya logon ko behkaanay ke liye lekin matlab ki tehqeeq ke liye aur deen ke ehkaam nikaalnay ke liye durust hai Nawawi) "
"2122","[AI-translation] ´Jundub bin Abdullah bijli raziyallahu anhu kehtay hain ke` Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya : Quran us waqt tak padho jab tak tumharay dil tumhari zubaan se muwaafaqat karein aur jab tumharay dil aur zubaan mein ikhtilaf paray to uth kharay ho "
